// The resonator (GDR-0026's boss sites, GDR-0027; GDR-0126): an anchored Lattice station (GDR-0110), to the Lattice
// what the hive is to the Swarm. Three spokes, west, east and south, each a focus emitter relayed through three prisms
// into one central prism that sends all three beams up the open lance mouth at its front: four prisms each, the
// longest reach a beam can have. Four resonant cores; two emitters on the arms' tips and two at the back guard the
// sides. Shoot a spoke's prism out and that beam loses reach; shoot the central prism out and the side spokes are
// blocked (the south one fires on, shorter). PLACEHOLDER layout (lead default, 20 Oct 2026).
(
    id: "lattice_resonator",
    name: "Lattice resonator",
    summary: "A 13×8 anchored crystal station: three prism spokes feed one great lance through its open mouth.",
    description: "It never moves, but it turns its lance mouth onto whatever comes near: three [[part:focus_emitter|focus emitters]] each send their beam through a spoke of [[part:prism|prisms]] into the central prism, which fires all three out of the mouth, further than any other Lattice beam. Each prism lost costs a beam reach; the central one, seen straight down the mouth, blocks the side spokes. Its sides and back have short emitters of their own. Beaten, it is the richest Lattice salvage there is.",
    lore: "Ships that drift too near hear it ring, a single clear note, before the light comes.",
    tags: ["lattice", "boss", "station", "inner"],
    faction: "lattice",
    behavior: "lattice_resonator",
